      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNDER ANESTHETIC (6) jumps from box 6 for the first time after placing latest at this track (29.67) in a Grade 4/5. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Overdue and is among the main hopes. DRINK TO THAT (2) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his excellent win three back, getting around The Gardens over 400m in 22.67. Top win three back and can measure up again. MISS GLAMOURPUSS (8) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Watch This (29.87) in a Grade 5. Led around the bend before fighting on well and should give a sight. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Leading player again. CESSNOCK CURTAIN (1) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
